      "start_seconds": 6.78,
      "end_seconds": 11.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.09,
      "end_seconds": 23.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "Mainly vomiting blood. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.37,
      "end_seconds": 28.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
